{"articleNo":"151495","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=151495&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[K-RC교육원] 2016-2분기 오름관2,3동 만족도조사 실시 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.05.23","hit":"2512","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2016-2</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분기 오름관</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2,3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">동 만족도 조사를 아래와 같이 실시합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">본 조사는 </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">BTL</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">생활관 운영 사업자가 제공하는 서비스 분야에 대한 관생들의 의견을 수렴하여 </span><